m/di/media/images/dw/20251115/1066334253073436672358602.jpeg/-TPuI-xfvRiIzofRXtcsOSWJ3USOHKKJGZlUfBmZVHw\"/><figcaption>老闆在當地時間14日再度拍攝影片向所有中國人道歉。（Facebook@Patrizio Pazzini）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「Panopath留學過來人」授權轉載，微信公眾號：Panopath_liuxue】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T01:38:51.544587+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":6327,"images":44,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}